  :single-finding-that-most-changed-my-model
  (str "That every non-trivial term in the live G is simultaneously at its "
       "neutral or degenerate value, and that no one decided this.\n\n"
       "On the production path today: A is the identity kernel (all adjudication "
       "rates zero), so the ambiguity term is identically 0 and no likelihood "
       "matrix is evaluated. C is a declared constant C_tau, not the step-indexed "
       "family horizonEFE is defined over. D is a point mass, not "
       "independent-belief. E is 1. F is 0. Beliefs are rollout predictions that "
       "never condition on an observation, although exact-update exists and is "
       "contract-bound. What remains, after all of that, is G = Sum_tau "
       "KL(q_tau || C_tau) against a constant preference.\n\n"
       "What changed my model is not that this is bad — each of those "
       "degeneracies is individually declared, individually defensible, and in "
       "most cases carries a cited theorem saying exactly when it is exact. The "
       "identity-A reduction is exact at zero rates and refuses rather than "
       "approximating otherwise. theta defaults to 1 with :theta-source "
       ":documented-default recorded. :complexity-term 0 cites "
       "vfe_posterior_eq. E is declared a neutral input. Six careful local "
       "decisions.\n\n"
       "The aggregate is that the War Machine's active-inference apparatus "
       "currently reduces to a single KL divergence against a fixed preference, "
       "and that outcome appears in no document, no ruling, and no node of the "
       "DAG I maintain. It is the product of six defensible choices none of "
       "which was wrong on its own. Before this study I would have said the "
       "problem was that things were unbuilt. The study says the mathematics is "
       "largely built and mostly disconnected, and that the disconnection "
       "compounds silently because each step declares itself honestly and "
       "nothing sums the declarations.\n\n"
       "The methodological half, which I got wrong in T6 and should record: I "
